    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5266,
        "endIndex": 5714,
        "text": "#### **[9] Anthropic and OpenEvidence partner to offer a specialized version of OpenEvidence's AI search tool for physicians in low- and middle-income countries (Reuters)**\n* **Confirmed:** Anthropic and medical platform OpenEvidence partnered to provide a free, specialized version of OpenEvidence's AI clinical decision support tool to doctors across ~100 low- and middle-income nations (e.g., Uganda, Haiti, Mongolia) powered by Anthropic models"
      },
