        "startIndex": 7227,
        "endIndex": 7551,
        "text": "#### **[13] Discord rolls out its updated age-verification policy this week (Engadget)**\n* **Confirmed:** Discord is rolling out a revised age-verification system that automatically classifies accounts into \"Adult\" or \"Teen\" cohorts based on account age and platform activity markers without scanning private message content"
